2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Louise also held, by marriage, the title Countess of Neipperg (1821-1834) and later Countess of Bombelles (1834-1847). She retained her imperial rank due to the 1814 Treaty of Paris as well as her titles Princess Imperial an
2 CONC d Archduchess of Austria, Princess Royal of Hungary and Bohemia.
2 CONT
