1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Wikipedia:''' [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Felice_Pasquale_Baciocchi English]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Felice Pasquale Bacciocchi''' (8 May 1762 – 27 April 1841) was an officer in the French army from a noble, but poor, Corsican family who married Elisa Maria Bonaparte in 1797. He was born at Ajaccio.
2 CONT
2 CONT After his brother-in-law's conquests, Bacciocchi became Prince of Lucca, but without the associated powers or the sovereign power, which really was exercised by his wife. They separated in 1805 and he moved to Rome, living a simpl
2 CONC e life there until his death.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Links===
