1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Napoleon III''', ne Louis-Napoléon Bonaparte, <br/>
2 CONT born in Paris, France, 20 April 1808, <br/>
2 CONT died 9 January 1873, Chislehurst, Kent, England, age 64.  
2 CONT
2 CONT 1st President of the French Second Republic (term 20 December 1848 – 2 December 1852) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Emperor of the Second French Empire (reign 2 December 1852 – 4 September 1870).
2 CONT
2 CONT Co-Prince of the nation of Andorra (reign 20 December 1848 - 4 September 1870)
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
