1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Giustina Pecori-Suárez, born on November 27, 1811 in Florence, Italy, was the third wife of Jerome Bonaparte, youngest brother of Emperor Napoleon I. She married on February 19, 1853 in Paris. She died on January 3
2 CONC 0, 1903 in Florence.
