1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Justine Marie Le Boeuf''', also known as Marguerite Bellanger, actress, acrobatic dancer, and mistress of Napoleon III. She was falsely rumoured to be the illegitimate daughter of a hangman, and was the most uni
2 CONC versally loathed of the mistresses, though perhaps his favorite.
2 CONT
2 CONT ________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT See also: 
2 CONT Les Amours de Napoléon III, mémoires de Marguerite Bellanger, sa maîtresse
2 CONT Author:Marguerite Bellanger (Author)
2 CONT Print Book, French, 1900
2 CONT Publisher: P. Fort, Paris, 1900
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.google.com/books/edition/Les_amours_de_Napol%C3%A9on_III/W8RCAAAAYAAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1
2 CONT
2 CONT Added November 11,2024 K. Welborn
