2 CONT
2 CONT His Imperial Highness Louis Napoléon, Prince Imperial of France (1870–1873)
2 CONT
2 CONT His Imperial Highness Prince Imperial Napoléon, Head of the Imperial House of France (1873–1879)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
