2 CONT https://www.thepeerage.com/p5957.htm#i59567:
2 CONT
2 CONT Zenaide Joukova 
2 CONT
2 CONT b. 1849, d. 20 June 1929 - дата смерти соответствует https://www.geni.com/people/Zinaida-Vasilyevna-Zhukova/6000000018451880063 (27.05.1863 – 02.07.1929)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT      Zenaide Joukova was born in 1849. She was the daughter of Vassili Joukov and Maria Alexandrovna Parijskaia. She married, firstly, Vassili Klokatchev. She and Vassili Klokatchev were divorced before 1882. She married, secondly
2 CONC , Youri Troubetzkoy on 4 October 1882. She died on 20 June 1929.
2 CONT      Her married name became Klokatchev. Her married name became Troubetzkoy.
2 CONT Children of Zenaide Joukova and Vassili Klokatchev
2 CONT
2 CONT Anatole Klokatchev b. c 1869
2 CONT Eugenie Klokatchev b. c 1871, d. 1923
2 CONT Children of Zenaide Joukova and Youri Troubetzkoy
2 CONT
2 CONT Princess Alexandra Troubetzkoy b. Jun 1882, d. 19 Oct 1900
2 CONT Princess Helene Troubetzkoy b. 8 Mar 1885
2 CONT Prince George Troubetzkoy+ b. 1888, d. 21 Jul 1909
2 CONT Princess Natalia Troubetzkoy b. Aug 1892
2 CONT Prince Wladimir Troubetzkoy+ b. 30 Jul 1894, d. 15 Mar 1973
2 CONT
2 CONT За Трубецким была замужем не она, а https://www.geni.com/people/Zinaida-Vasilyevna-Zhukova/6000000018451880063 (27.05.1863 – 02.07.1929)
2 CONT
