3 TEXT Charles XV , Carl Ludwig Eugen , born 3 May 1826 in Stockholm Palace in Stockholm , died 18 September 1872 at the residence in Malmö , was King of Sweden and Norway from 1859 to Norwegian regent named Charles IV [ 1 ] (while there
4 CONC  was also called Charles XV on contemporary coins [ 2 ] ), previously Duke of Skåne. He was the son of King Oscar I and Queen Josephine and married June 19, 1850 by Lovisa of the Netherlands
4 CONT
