2 CONC  much approval. The state winners resisted them. Ereliukas ruled only 15 days - since 1815 June 22 until 1815 July 7. The damsel grew up in the Grandfather's Palace in Vienna where he was given Reichstadt (Reichstadt Duke's title)
2 CONC  up until 1830. Ereliukas did not know who his real father was. The hopes of Napoleon II were tied by Bonapartists but in 1830 was overthrown by King Charles X of France, Napoleon II was already too weak to take on the throne, He 
2 CONC was sick and died early (21 years old). His pompous mask is exhibited at the Vienna Schonbrunn Palace. One day Melanija and Ereliukas got acquainted. The eaglet Melanija old age is pasakojusi nephew Marcelijus (Marcin ) Kostrovick
2 CONC iui (brother Lucian, who was married to Jozefa Sekliuckytę ( Jozefa Sieklucka ), son), it gives him not only for his oil paintings, but also drawings, watercolors and oil painted works with Reichštato Duke's signature. Melanija an
2 CONC d Erelius became lovers. Here a son was born to Melanija (who was 18 years old) born in Italy, finding herself with explainable circumstances. The kidnapper - a child of the Imperial Blood - was arranged and educated (for the mone
2 CONC y of Kostriewitz) in the Vatican. Later Melanija returned to Lithuania and lived in her father's estate. Both her and Erelique's grandson - the son of a son of a son of a son-in-law in Italy became Apoliner. So Napoleon would be t
2 CONC he grandfather of Apolinero. However, this version is clearly confirmed, because until now it was argued that there are other Apolineras Kostrovickaitės (the other belonging to another family, and the coat of arms). Michael Kostro
2 CONC vickio ( Michal Kostrowicki ) daughter Angelica (Angelika) was unmarried and had a child born in Rome, his father is not exactly known.
