2 CONC e Berg et Clèves (1806-1808), roi de Naples (1808-1815 http://fmoreaunapoleon33310.wordpress.com/2011/04/27/descendance-de-caroline-bonaparte-grande-duchesse-de-berg-et-cleves-reine-de-naples-comtesse-de-lipona-1782-1839-epouse-de
2 CONC -joachim-murat-marechal-de-lempire-grand-amiral-de-lempire-grand/ m 1stly at Paris 5 Feb 1913 (m diss by div at Paris 7 Nov 1928) Hélène Macdonald Stallo (b at Cincinnati, OH 5 Sep 1893; d at Paris 1 Apr 1932), dau of Edmund Kirkb
2 CONC ride Stallo and Laura Macdonald. m 2ndly at Paris 25 Sep 1939 (Helen) Isabelle MacMillan (b at New York 7 Sep 1899; + at Paris 7 Feb 1858), and had issue by 1st,
