2 CONT Sarah Copeland's second husband was Benjamin Williams.  He was the father of Susan May Williams.  Susan May Williams married Jerome Napoleon Bonaparte (1805-  ).  He was the son of Jerome Bonaparte and Elizabeth Patterson, and the
2 CONC  nephew of Napoleon Bonaparte.  Sarah Copeland's grandson married Carolyn Le Roy Appleton, the granddaughter of Daniel Webster.
