1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Födelse: 	1719 - Bâle,Bâle,Suisse
2 CONT * Död:	1787 - Bâle,Bâle,Suisse
2 CONT * Föräldrar:	Hans Jacob Bischoff, Margaretha Augusta Bischoff (född Burckhardt)
2 CONT * Make:	M. LUCAS GERNLER
2 CONT * Barn:	LUCAS GERNLEZ, JOHANN LUCAS GERNLEZ, THEODORUS GERNLER, Augusta Maria Gernlez, Anna Catharina von Pfeffel und Kriegelstein (född Gernler), Valeria Gernlez, Salome Gernler
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/world-europe-42805485
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thehindu.com/news/international/swiss-mummy-found-to-be-ancestor-of-boris-johnson/article22523012.ece
2 CONT
2 CONT The BBC says DNA extracted from the mummy’s toe has revealed she is Anna Catharina Bischoff, a member of a prominent Basel family who died in 1787.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://news.sky.com/story/mummy-found-under-swiss-church-is-boris-johnson-relative-11222141:
2 CONT
2 CONT Bischoff was born in 1719 into a wealthy Basel family and married a pastor before having seven children, two of whom survived to become adults.
2 CONT
2 CONT She spent most of her life in Strasbourg but returned to Basel for her final five years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Syphilis-ridden 18th century mummy dug up in Swiss church is relative of Boris Johnson, http://www.telegraph.co.uk/science/2018/01/25/syphilis-ridden-18th-century-mummy-dug-swiss-church-relative/
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Catharina had seven children, including Anna who married Christian Hubert Baron Pfeffel von Kriegelstein. Her great great grandaughter, Marie Luise von Pfeffel married Stanley Fred Williams and their daughter Irene, who Boris
2 CONC  always referred to as ‘Granny Butter’ wed his grandfather Wilfred ‘Johnson’ Kemal.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/europe/swiss-mummy-identified-as-ancestor-of-boris-johnson/2018/01/25/1f4d1802-01cf-11e8-86b9-8908743c79dd_story.html?utm_term=.6cf16f4ed5c9
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.telegraph.co.uk/science/2018/01/25/syphilis-ridden-18th-century-mummy-dug-swiss-church-relative/
