2 CONT
2 CONT Vassili Klokatchev was born on 16 October 1834. He married Zenaide Joukova, daughter of Vassili Joukov and Maria Alexandrovna Parijskaia. He and Zenaide Joukova were divorced before 1882. He died on 9 November 1889 at age 55.
2 CONT Children of Vassili Klokatchev and Zenaide Joukova
2 CONT
2 CONT !!!! Василий Николаевич Клокачев не был женат на Зинаиде Васильевне Жуковой (27.05.1863 – 20.06.1929) и не  мог иметь от нее детей: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anatole Klokatchev b. c 1869
2 CONT Eugenie Klokatchev b. c 1871, d. 1923
2 CONT
