1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Armand Fidele Jean-Baptiste Denis de Kereden de Tobriand (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #299345, b. 1799, d. 1866
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=4 Jul 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT      Armand Fidele Jean-Baptiste Denis de Kereden de Tobriand was born in 1799. (1) He married Fanny Denis de Kereden de Tobriand, daughter of Eugène de Beauharnais, 1st Duc de Leuchtenberg and Louise Jeanne Nicole Arnolde Denis d
2 CONC e Kereden de Tobriand de Masa y Leunda y Aristiguieta. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1866. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p29935.htm#i299345
