2 CONT *[http://thepeerage.com/p11051.htm#i110501 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[https://geneall.net/de/name/18491/georg-prinz-romanovsky-6-herzog-von-leuchtenberg/ Geneall]
2 CONT *[http://www.hansdenyngre.dk/hans_uk/wizg43.htm#3707 Johann The Younger # 1507] + [http://www.hansdenyngre.dk/hans_uk/wizg33.htm#3258 # 1635]
