1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Carlos IV, Rey de España
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #103517, b. 12 November 1748, d. 19 January 1819
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=11 Mar 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=2.88%
2 CONT
2 CONT Carlos IV, Rey de España was born on 12 November 1748 at Palazzo Reale, Pottici, Napoli, Italy. (2) He was the son of Carlos III de Borbón, Rey de España and Marie Amalie Prinzessin von Sachsen. He married Maria Luisa di Borbone, 
2 CONC Principessa di Parma, daughter of Filippo di Borbone, Duca di Parma and Louise Elisabeth de Bourbon, on 4 September 1765 at San Ildefonso, Spain. (2) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 19 January 1819 at age 70 at Rome, Italy. (2)
2 CONT
2 CONT Carlos IV, Rey de España was a member of the House of Bourbon. He succeeded to the title of Rey Carlos IV de España in 1788. (3) He abdicated as King of Spain in 1808.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Carlos IV, Rey de España and Maria Luisa di Borbone, Principessa di Parma
2 CONT
