2 FORM jpg
2 NOTE Grand Duchess Alexandra Pavlovna of Russia depicted on her wedding day with Archduke Joseph Anton of Austria (József nádor), Palatine of Hungary, 1799.
3 CONT The illustration is based on a work by Henrik Ortenburg (“Öröm” – “Joy”).
