2 CONT * Mary Willis  1755-1778
2 CONT * Henry W Willis  1755-1761
2 CONT * Jane Willis  1755-1760
2 CONT * Mildred Willis  1751-1772
2 CONT
2 CONT He is married to (2) Anne Byrd Carter in the year 1774 at Virginia, United States, he was 39 years old.
2 CONT
