1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Emma Livry (born as Jeanne Emma Emarot or Emma Marie Emarot) was one of the last famous ballerinas of the Romantic ballet era and a protégée of Marie Taglioni. She died young from complications after burn injuries 
2 CONC sustained when her costume caught fire during a rehearsal. Livry was the illegitimate daughter of Célestine Emarot, a ballet dancer, and Baron Charles de Chassiron.
2 CONT
