1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wilhelmine Baronin von Tunderfeldt-Rhodis ▼1
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #110541, b. 18 January 1777, d. 6 February 1822
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=30 Nov 2002
2 CONT
2 CONT      Wilhelmine Baronin von Tunderfeldt-Rhodis was born on 18 January 1777 at Rhodis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=30 Nov 2002
2 CONT
2 CONT      Wilhelmine Baronin von Tunderfeldt-Rhodis was born on 18 January 1777 at Rhodis. ▼2 She was the daughter of Karl August Baron von Tunderfeldt-Rhodis. ▼2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Wilhelm Friedrich Herzog von Württemberg, son of Friedrich II Eugen Heinrich Herzog von Württemberg and Friederike Dorothea Prinzessin von Brandenburg-Schwedt, on 23 August 1800 at Dessau, Sachsen-Anhalt, Germany. ▼2 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 6 February 1822 at age 45 at Florence, Italy. ▼2
2 CONT
2 CONT      Wilhelmine Baronin von Tunderfeldt-Rhodis gained the title of Baronin von Tunderfeldt-Rhodis. ▼1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Wilhelmine Baronin von Tunderfeldt-Rhodis and Wilhelm Friedrich Herzog von Württemberg
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Alexander Graf von Württemberg+ ▼2 b. 5 Nov 1801, d. 7 Jul 1844
2 CONT
