2 CONT ydna Iberian  I M170 > I M253 > DF29 >  CT56354 >  L22 Name of Spiers thought to be taken on.   Tester names of lines back to WERNER, ROBERT SPIERS, WILLIAM H. SPEARS same group Iberian I M253 L22    
2 CONT
2 CONT Community Transfer Group into MS was by Passport from Choctaw Bill as it was New Spain claimed at the time.  You did not get in without a pass.  Werner might be from Warner  as the SC and Ga incoming transfer community named had a
2 CONC  Warner/Warren from Warrener as a middle name for group coming over with Choctaw Bill)
2 CONT
2 CONT Family name:  Werner or Warner or Warren?  There are some Bush, Louisianna incoming Warren sir named  cousins who are buried about 15 miles south of the Bogalusa, La -Richardson cousin (who came from Ga)  who came in coordination 
2 CONC with Choctaw Bill Williams with his group from Horry Co SC and had a contingient in BUrke Co, GA with Capt John Lott's group there and then they all coordinated to come over together as Choctaw Bill was the supplier of arms for th
2 CONC e 1812 War, was also the first Pre-Bureau of Indian Affairs Agent.  
2 CONT
