1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LHJZ-715/samuel-smith-1752-1839
2 CONT When Samuel Smith was born on 27 July 1752, in Carlisle, Cumberland, Pennsylvania, United States, his father, James John Smith, was 29 and his mother, Mary Molly Buchanan, was 28. He married Margaret Spear on 31 December 1778, in 
2 CONC First Presbyterian Church, Baltimore, Baltimore, Maryland, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 7 daughters. He registered for military service in 1776. He died on 22 April 1839, in Baltimore City, Maryland,
2 CONC  United States, at the age of 86, and was buried in Baltimore, Baltimore, Maryland, United States.
