2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel Morton (1765 - 1808)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Nathaniel Morton===
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 9 Apr 1765 in Prince Edward, Virginia
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John Morton and Mary Elizabeth Ellen (Anderson) Morton
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Charles Morton, Elizabeth (Morton) Woodson, James Morton, Hezekiah Morton, Benjamin Morton, Jacob Morton, Josiah Morton, Mary (Morton) Fuqua, Nancy (Morton) Thompson, Sarah (Morton) Fuqua, John Archer Morton, Richard Mo
2 CONC rton, Obediah Morton and Martha Morton
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Sarah (Copeland) Williams — married 23 Feb 1798 in Harford, Maryland, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of George Copeland Morton and Mary Adelaide (Morton) Stewart
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 22 Jan 1808 at age 42 in Baltimore, Maryland, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 13 Oct 2023 | Created 2 Jan 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Mary Adelaide Morton Stewart. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
