1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Golden Fleece - Knights: Austrian Branch ===
2 CONT *George  Augustus Frederick Prince of United Kingdom und Hannover
2 CONT *1st Earl of Carrick on 12 August 1762.
2 CONT *1st Baron Renfrew on 12 August 1762.
2 CONT *1st Lord of the Isles on 12 August 1762.
2 CONT *1st Duke of Cornwall on 12 August 1762.
2 CONT *1st Duke of Rothesay on 12 August 1762.
2 CONT *1st Earl of Chester [Great Britain] on 17 August 1762.
2 CONT *Prince of Wales [Great Britain] on 17 August 1762.
2 CONT *He and Mary Darby were associated between 1779 and 1781.
2 CONT *He and Frances Twysden were associated between 1782 and 1803.
2 CONT *He and Hon. Isabella Anne Ingram-Shepheard were associated between 1807 and 1819. 
2 CONT *Prince Regent of the United Kingdom on 5 February 1811.  King of the United Kingdom on 29 January 1820.
2 CONT *He and Elizabeth Denison were associated before 1821. 
2 CONT *Crowned King of the United Kingdom on 19 July 1821 at Westminster Abbey, Westminster, London, England
2 CONT *Styled 'By the Grace of God, of the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland, King, Defender of the Faith
2 CONT *Knights of the Order of the Golden Fleece-Austria (893) - 1814 
2 CONT *Knights of the Order of the Golden Fleece-Spain (867) - 1814
2 CONT *Knights of the Order of the Garter (584) - 1765
