2 CONT William II, King of Württemberg (born 25 February 1848 in Stuttgart; died 2 October 1921 in Bebenhausen) was the son of Prince Frederick of Württemberg (1808–1870) and his wife Princess Catherine of Württemberg (1821–1898), daught
2 CONC er of King William I of Württemberg (1781–1864).
