2 CONT Prince Paul of Yugoslavia is Aurora Karamzin's great grandson! ( Aurora Demidova -* Stjernvall ) http://www.geni.com/path/Aurora-Karamzin+is+related+to+Prince-Paul-of-Yugoslavia?from=6000000004396685338&to=6000000000668746132
2 CONT
