1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Full name: '''French:''' Léopold Louis Philippe Marie Victor, '''Dutch:''' Leopold Lodewijk Filips Maria Victor
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://www.thepeerage.com/p10234.htm#i102340 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[http://www.geneall.net/W/per_page.php?id=5869 Geneall]
