2 CONT ==Chapelle Notre-Dame-des-Anges==
2 CONT
2 CONT This chapel built in 1696, with the permission of the Bishop of Basel, for Nicolas Bischoff priest, a native of Ferrette, was dedicated to Our Lady of the Angels, but is still called Notre Dame de Leaking the exceptional word in A
2 CONC lsace; it was consecrated in 1697 and became a place of pilgrimage; it was served by the Franciscan Abbey Luppach which it retains furniture items; restoration in 1956 
