0 @N6000000002322348634@ NOTE His dream was a "federation of free peoples" launched him as the arch-hero of
1 CONT the French and a martyr to the world. "Power is my mystress" was Napoleon,
1 CONT never secure, never satisfied, though he conquered most of Europe before
1 CONT Europe united against one who only wanted change via an end to feudalism and
1 CONT serfdom, freedom of religion, a constitution for each state with a bill of
1 CONT rights and education for all people, with his "Code Napoleon" under his new
1 CONT regime, the Consulate, overthrowing the French monarchy  Nov-9/10-1799.
