0 @N6000000002176689126@ NOTE Her husband's health began to fail in 1856, suffering from bladder stone
1 CONT attacks, which temperarily incapacitated him as Emperor, electing a Vice
1 CONT Emperor later. After his 1870 surrender to the Germans and he was released
