1 CONT considered one of the most capable of the 18th-century reformist rulers known
1 CONT as the "enlightened despots." Although he dismantled some of the centralized
1 CONT state machinery that Joseph had set up in the Habsburg domains, he kept in
1 CONT force Joseph's decrees that emancipated the peasantry and granted increased
1 CONT religious liberty to non-catholics. Leopold died less than two months before
1 CONT France declared war on Austria.
